{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971790/extras/ab8f4e8873a4b817a297a442c3f66460.poster.avif?t=1756482955\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971790/extras/ab8f4e8873a4b817a297a442c3f66460.webm?t=1756482955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971790/extras/ab8f4e8873a4b817a297a442c3f66460.mp4?t=1756482955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The demo version features content from only two of the eight hosts available in the full game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to &quot;<i>A Sexy Quiz Show&quot;</i>,</strong> where brains, not brawn, win the ultimate prize!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step up to the podium and prove your intellectual prowess across a variety of categories. Your knowledge is your key to victory, and your performance unlocks the rewards you <i>really</i> want.\u00a0\ud83d\udd1e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971790/extras/09d14542ffa5419cf2dbdf1fba2a7d2f.poster.avif?t=1756482955\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971790/extras/09d14542ffa5419cf2dbdf1fba2a7d2f.webm?t=1756482955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971790/extras/09d14542ffa5419cf2dbdf1fba2a7d2f.mp4?t=1756482955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcfa Meet your hosts:</strong> The game features charismatic hosts, each with a unique personality and a specialized quiz category.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd1e<strong> The Better You Play, The More You See:</strong> Our hosts don't just read questions\u2014they react to your performance!  The more questions you get right, the more they'll... <i>appreciate</i> your talent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2764\ufe0f Earn Hearts, Unlock Rewards:</strong> Stellar performance isn't just for show. Earn &quot;Hearts&quot; \ud83d\udc96 by completing quizzes, achieving high accuracy, and finishing in record time. Spend your Hearts in the Shop to permanently unlock naughty images and videos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2753 A True Quiz Challenge:\u00a0</strong>Test your knowledge with 20 questions per session, pulled from a pool of 30 to ensure replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca1 Lifelines When You Need Them:</strong> Use two powerful lifelines per session\u2014<strong>50/50</strong> to remove two wrong answers, or <strong>Skip Question</strong> to get an automatic correct answer and move on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6\u00a0Achievements</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcbe Save system</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you have what it takes to conquer A Sexy Quiz Show?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971790/extras/506b747545201df483f2712b5f7b1f38.poster.avif?t=1756482955\" width=600 height=3